Learn the best practices for AWS Billing and Cost Management.

- [Logging API calls with CloudTrail](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awsaccountbilling/latest/aboutv2/logging-using-cloudtrail.md): Use AWS CloudTrail to log API actions for your AWS account.
- [Compliance validation](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awsaccountbilling/latest/aboutv2/Billing-compliance.md): Learn what AWS services are in scope of a specific compliance program.
- [Resilience](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awsaccountbilling/latest/aboutv2/disaster-recovery-resiliency.md): Learn how AWS architecture supports data redundancy, and learn about specific AWS Billing and Cost Management features for data resiliency.

### [Infrastructure security](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awsaccountbilling/latest/aboutv2/infrastructure-security.md)

Learn how AWS Billing and Cost Management isolates service traffic.

- [AWS PrivateLink](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awsaccountbilling/latest/aboutv2/vpc-interface-endpoints.md): You can use an AWS PrivateLink to create a private connection between your VPC and AWS Billing and Cost Management.


